# The image build's context (podman build ... . from the repository root). linux/image/Containerfile
# copies only linux/ and the shell tarball, and Containerfile.nvidia files from linux/image/, so the
# rest need not be sent; the tarball must not sit in a folder left out here.
.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
apps/desktop/release
upstream/hermes-agent
output
linux/vm/build
packaging/arch/*/src
packaging/arch/*/pkg
packaging/arch/*/herald-os
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.venv
**/*.qcow2
**/*.raw
**/*.iso
# Secrets, should one sit in the checkout: none is copied into the image, and none should reach the
# build either.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/cosign.key
